# The expertise module's validation surface (issue #263 — SkillProficiency well-formedness
# and level/scale consistency, Credential attestation/issuer/target-range checks) is authored
# entirely as logic: core content in slices/core/expertise/module.ttl and projected to
# generated/shapes/validation-shapes.ttl + generated/shapes/procedural-constraints.ttl. This
# file carries no hand-authored sh:NodeShape: every check is a canonical logic: constraint or
# an EL-safe OWL/RDFS axiom whose SHACL image the pipeline derives. The file is retained (not
# deleted) as the stable, intentionally shape-free anchor for the expertise validation
# namespace.
